    {"symbol": "🏰", "tooltip": "A compute license is a drawbridge the biggest labs pull up behind themselves after they've already crossed."},
    {"symbol": "📊", "tooltip": "The regime regulates a number on a spreadsheet while the foundries, grids, and water tables sit untouched."}
