e harm is not hypothetical concentration — it's the patient whose cure stayed in a queue. Who gave the licensor the right to make that trade on their behalf? Show me the irreversible-concentration event that open-weight proliferation has actually caused. Until then, the gate is asking real people to pay a measured price today to prevent a harm it can only describe in the conditional tense.",
